  m_text: "My first night\u2026 strange but manageable.\n\nHe asked for the flame
    of day, captured between flesh and wheat. I hesitated, but gave him what felt
    right. His grin stretched too long. The lights trembled when he left.\n\nWhy
    did the air smell like smoke, though nothing burned?"
